n: 3.4.8.6
name: grammar-and-jit-in-the-language
kind: finding
is: Keep grammar as data with reversible rules, so that a surface syntax is a small rule file over the node tree, and keep heat-driven compilation written in the language itself, with one definition of each operation shared by the interpreter and the compiled code.
status: inferred
