n: 3.4.9.5
name: absence-leaks-and-loose-truth
kind: finding
is: Drop the places where absence or refusal is not the one value nothing: sentinels -1, 0 and the one-element list; true and false as integers; a branch taking empty strings and lists as true; two renderings of nothing; two equalities disagreeing on 1 and 1.0; an assert that cannot fail; a stop whose reason attempt drops and only a cell call keeps.
